**My answer to the prompt:**

```html
<p>Write a program to find the largest number among 3 numbers.</p>
<input type="number" placeholder="Enter 1st number" id="t1">
<br>
<input type="number" placeholder="Enter 2nd number" id="t2">
<br>
<input type="number" placeholder="Enter 3rd number" id="t3">
<button onclick="check()">Check</button>
<h3 id="ans">The largest number is</h3>

<script>
function check() {
    const n1 = Number(document.getElementById("t1").value);
    const n2 = Number(document.getElementById("t2").value);
    const n3 = Number(document.getElementById("t3").value);

    const largest = Math.max(n1, n2, n3);
    document.getElementById("ans").textContent = "The largest is " + largest;
}
</script>
```

