```js
await page.waitForSelector('[data-testid="prediction_option"]');

const result = await page.$eval(
  '[data-testid="prediction_option"]',
  element => element.textContent.trim()
);

console.log('Result:', result);
```

This selects the first matching element. If you want the contents of every matching element, use `page.$$eval()` instead.

